{# ── ONE WORD IN ONE LIST ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
   The word, what tells it apart, how often it was answered, and the actions a
   never-deleted registry allows. Every row of a list is the same height whether
   or not it carries a note or a retired badge, and a row being renamed is exactly
   as tall as its siblings, because the field takes the row's own control height.

   THREE STATES AND NO FOURTH:
     · live         — the word, Rename and Retire.
     · mid-rename   — the label becomes a field in the label's own place, and the
                      two actions become Save and Cancel. The whole row is the
                      form, so the field and the act belong to one submit.
     · retired      — dimmed, its retirement dated in a quiet badge, its counts
                      still true, and Reactivate as its only action. NEVER struck
                      through: a strike says the word was a mistake and is gone,
                      and retired means the opposite.

   THE COUNTS ARE FACTS AND NEVER THRESHOLDS. Nothing here sorts by them, colours
   on them or suggests anything from them.

   Parameters: area, list, row, renaming, csrfToken
   ========================================================================== #}
{%- if renaming -%}
    <form class="srow" method="post" action="{{ path('incident_lists_rename', {uuid: area.uuid, entry: row.uuid}) }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
        <input class="sren" type="text" name="label" value="{{ row.label }}" aria-label="Rename this entry"
               maxlength="120" required autofocus>
        {% if row.note %}<span class="note">{{ row.note }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="n">{{ row.countsLabel }}</span>
        <span class="acts">
            <button class="sact" type="submit">Save</button>
            <a class="sact" href="{{ path('incident_lists', {uuid: area.uuid, list: list.value}) }}">Cancel</a>
        </span>
    </form>
{%- else -%}
    <div class="srow{{ row.active ? '' : ' gone' }}">
        <span class="nm">{{ row.label }}</span>
        {% if row.note %}<span class="note">{{ row.note }}</span>{% endif %}
        {% if not row.active %}<span class="chip idle">retired {{ row.retiredAt|date('j M')|lower }}</span>{% endif %}
        <span class="n">{{ row.countsLabel }}</span>
        <span class="acts">
            {% if row.active %}
                <a class="sact" href="{{ path('incident_lists', {uuid: area.uuid, list: list.value, rename: row.uuid}) }}">Rename</a>
                <form method="post" action="{{ path('incident_lists_retire', {uuid: area.uuid, entry: row.uuid}) }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
                    <button class="sact warn" type="submit">Retire</button>
                </form>
            {% else %}
                <form method="post" action="{{ path('incident_lists_reactivate', {uuid: area.uuid, entry: row.uuid}) }}">
                    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrfToken }}">
                    <button class="sact" type="submit">Reactivate</button>
                </form>
            {% endif %}
        </span>
    </div>
{%- endif -%}
